/T43n1833_p0851c01","n":"0851c","t":"防名多亦得所持有六能持之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0852a01","n":"0852a","t":"等答我宗隨眠但可說為貪等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0852b01","n":"0852b","t":"詳曰若世共了名現所知何事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0852c01","n":"0852c","t":"由聲亦名具聲由智惠力斷惑"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0853a01","n":"0853a","t":"故知不取依識變者問難意云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0853b01","n":"0853b","t":"無色而是常住問色界何無答"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0853c01","n":"0853c","t":"疏有義其想受滅滅屬想受是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0854b01","n":"0854b","t":"復有執心心所法能了俱有如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0854c01","n":"0854c","t":"緣緣餘心所亦復如是前雖多"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0855a01","n":"0855a","t":"小乘及以外道二依類等下別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0855b01","n":"0855b","t":"說似火雖與德離猶說似火故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0855c01","n":"0855c","t":"實德而依於德假說火者可許"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0856a01","n":"0856a","t":"自也雖小乘等而非一類總皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0856b01","n":"0856b","t":"詮自相施設假智亦爾不離自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0857a01","n":"0857a","t":"為境然此相分實不通餘但是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0857c01","n":"0857c","t":"二性上二界中等流二性異熟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0858a01","n":"0858a","t":"有最勝能名藏最勝大等諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0858b01","n":"0858b","t":"故不取之若爾賴耶應非淨依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0859b01","n":"0859b","t":"即諸法或是善惡於餘生中先"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0859c01","n":"0859c","t":"三家也其本有家雖不許生然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0860a01","n":"0860a","t":"出世無漏之心名為種子如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0860b01","n":"0860b","t":"有二也如文易知此本有難難"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0860c01","n":"0860c","t":"為不善因故按瑜伽論第二十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0861b01","n":"0861b","t":"初標言一切種故略為二釋一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0861c01","n":"0861c","t":"現字何煩疏說云顯現簡耶答"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0862b01","n":"0862b","t":"有用果非無可說果由現因起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0862c01","n":"0862c","t":"或相從言總名生也彼云無失"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0863a01","n":"0863a","t":"故故能生心問所熏種為一為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0863b01","n":"0863b","t":"行力能生應即墮故亦非動勢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0863c01","n":"0863c","t":"六識異熟無非能熏無別聖教"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0864a01","n":"0864a","t":"也故疏自云今日為增明不結"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0864b01","n":"0864b","t":"所執故彼所發不離大聲亦名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0865a01","n":"0865a","t":"時亦緣假者即無有失詳曰理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0865b01","n":"0865b","t":"微細故不唯言根身濫外塵不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0866a01","n":"0866a","t":"別似名同一見分體緣各各異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0866b01","n":"0866b","t":"諸師皆言清辨有相而無見者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0866c01","n":"0866c","t":"青等相分俱青故名為總由是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0867a01","n":"0867a","t":"自證不須第四隨彼相見同種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0867b01","n":"0867b","t":"名外也以彼皆是自身外故五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0867c01","n":"0867c","t":"句二云淨穢其處既同即是第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0868a01","n":"0868a","t":"業增上所感如是而生何以故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0868b01","n":"0868b","t":"證第三分已何須第四為證量"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0869a01","n":"0869a","t":"別發亦復何失按智度論修得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0869b01","n":"0869b","t":"此一向定言變身