"n":"0878a","t":"有四釋初後為勝中二違理染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0878b01","n":"0878b","t":"因亦爾宗因皆有二三合等其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0878c01","n":"0878c","t":"外道是立論餘乘便云矣因宗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0879a01","n":"0879a","t":"此法歡喜信受言喜法者謂於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0879b01","n":"0879b","t":"無學人也即無性論第三云雖"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0879c01","n":"0879c","t":"故六種轉識不定俱生不俱生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0880a01","n":"0880a","t":"性生不善無間復善性生從二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0880b01","n":"0880b","t":"應識等更生若諸識非色種子"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0880c01","n":"0880c","t":"界地等前後轉變故識體事不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0881a01","n":"0881a","t":"據自身凡聖前後或約他自凡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0881c01","n":"0881c","t":"見釋成大邪見不是破救也詳"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0882a01","n":"0882a","t":"空故不可謂斷有說彼時生得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0882b01","n":"0882b","t":"根諸分中間相連續故如碎杜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0882c01","n":"0882c","t":"詳曰餘釋及斷理皆有餘豈無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0883a01","n":"0883a","t":"為彼遠緣亦應無失如因欲善"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0883b01","n":"0883b","t":"心位現在五根何名執受答執"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0883c01","n":"0883c","t":"言濫何但有三答具如疏燈有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0884a01","n":"0884a","t":"是其喻因法可知壽煖喻上無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0884b01","n":"0884b","t":"釋理可然也言無餘者釋可然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0884c01","n":"0884c","t":"和合之識是意識性不應道理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0885a01","n":"0885a","t":"言又相違因立敵共許不爾其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0885b01","n":"0885b","t":"可了知故非意識釋曰染污因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.t