3_p0978b01","n":"0978b","t":"等種同生有漏二分殊性種何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1833_p0978c01","n":"0978c","t":"勝義初四化身第五化像第六"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1833-成唯識論演祕","source":"CBETA T43n1833 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":503,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}